{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"oceanic-next-dark","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Oceanic Next","description":"Soft blue-gray with sea green and coral.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Themes"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"themes":[{"label":"Oceanic Next","path":"themes/oceanic-next-dark.json","uiTheme":"dark"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"themes/oceanic-next-dark.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"Oceanic Next\",\n  \"type\": \"dark\",\n  \"colors\": {\n    \"editor.background\": \"#1b2b34\",\n    \"editor.foreground\": \"#cdd3de\",\n    \"sideBar.background\": \"#17242b\",\n    \"activityBar.background\": \"#142026\",\n    \"titleBar.activeBackground\": \"#142026\",\n    \"tab.inactiveBackground\": \"#17242b\",\n    \"list.hoverBackground\": \"#243742\",\n    \"list.activeSelectionBackground\": \"#343d46\",\n    \"input.background\": \"#243742\",\n    \"editorWidget.background\": \"#17242b\",\n    \"panel.border\": \"#142026\",\n    \"focusBorder\": \"#6699cc\",\n    \"button.background\": \"#6699cc\",\n    \"textLink.foreground\": \"#6699cc\",\n    \"editor.selectionBackground\": \"#343d46\",\n    \"editor.lineHighlightBackground\": \"#24374280\",\n    \"editorCursor.foreground\": \"#6699cc\",\n    \"editorIndentGuide.background\": \"#142026\",\n    \"errorForeground\": \"#ec5f67\",\n    \"gitDecoration.addedResourceForeground\": \"#99c794\",\n    \"gitDecoration.modifiedResourceForeground\": \"#fac863\",\n    \"gitDecoration.deletedResourceForeground\": \"#ec5f67\"\n  },\n  \"tokenColors\": [\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"comment\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#65737e\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"string\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#99c794\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.numeric\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#f99157\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"keyword\",\n        \"storage\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#c594c5\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.type\",\n        \"support.type\",\n        \"storage.type\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#fac863\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function\",\n        \"support.function\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#6699cc\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.language\",\n        \"constant\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#f99157\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"variable.other.property\",\n        \"support.type.property-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#5fb3b3\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.tag\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#ec5f67\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.other.attribute-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#fac863\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function.macro\",\n        \"meta.preprocessor\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#5fb3b3\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Oceanic Next\n\nSoft blue-gray with sea green and coral.\n\nInstall it, then pick **Oceanic Next** in **Settings > Colour theme**. It is a dark theme.\n\nInspired by the Oceanic Next palette by Dmitri Voronianski (MIT).\n\n| Role | Color |\n| --- | --- |\n| Background | `#1b2b34` |\n| Text | `#cdd3de` |\n| Accent | `#6699cc` |\n| Keywords | `#c594c5` |\n| Strings | `#99c794` |\n| Functions | `#6699cc` |\n| Types | `#fac863` |\n| Comments | `#65737e` |\n\nThis extension is only a theme: it runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}